OL,3,GNEWSARachel Millward sets out Green's
OL,4,Apitch to London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe party conference season is under
OL,7,Fway - the annual gatherings of
OL,8,Fpolitical party leaders and activists
OL,9,Fcontinue with the Green Party of
OL,10,FEngland and Wales in Brighton from
OL,11,FFriday.
OL,13,FBBC London's political editor Karl
OL,14,FMercer is sitting down with leaders and
OL,15,Fother senior party figures to discuss
OL,16,Fsome of the key issues facing the
OL,17,Fcapital and what their party might do
OL,18,Fto tackle them.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
